{
    "title": "DateUp - Tall Dating Made Easy",
    "description": "DateUp\u2019s mission is to create the best dating experience for tall women, but people of all heights are welcome. \r\n\r\nA dating app focused on height.\r\n\r\nHOW IT WORKS\r\n\r\nMen 6'0\"+ and women 5'8\"+ join as \"Members,\" and can match with other Members or with \"Guests.\" Guests are shorter people that are interested in \"dating-up.\"\r\n\r\nEverybody has the option to quickly and easily verify their height through DateUp's unique height-verification process.\r\n\r\nWHY DATEUP? \r\n\r\nThe idea of DateUp was sparked by the clear difficulty that tall women face when dating. In particular, it can be difficult for tall women to find other tall men or shorter men that are comfortable with dating-up.\r\n\r\nDateUp offers a safe place for tall people to find height-compatible matches with other tall people nearby, or with shorter people that want to date-up. DateUp is intentionally designed to create a balance between an exclusive and inclusive experience. \r\n\r\nWhat if you're not tall, but dating-up is your thing? You've still found the right place. While tall people are treated like VIP on DateUp, everyone is welcome to the party.",
    "descriptionHTML": "DateUp\u2019s mission is to create the best dating experience for tall women, but people of all heights are welcome. <br><br>A dating app focused on height.<br><br>HOW IT WORKS<br><br>Men 6&#39;0&quot;+ and women 5&#39;8&quot;+ join as &quot;Members,&quot; and can match with other Members or with &quot;Guests.&quot; Guests are shorter people that are interested in &quot;dating-up.&quot;<br><br>Everybody has the option to quickly and easily verify their height through DateUp&#39;s unique height-verification process.<br><br>WHY DATEUP? <br><br>The idea of DateUp was sparked by the clear difficulty that tall women face when dating. In particular, it can be difficult for tall women to find other tall men or shorter men that are comfortable with dating-up.<br><br>DateUp offers a safe place for tall people to find height-compatible matches with other tall people nearby, or with shorter people that want to date-up. DateUp is intentionally designed to create a balance between an exclusive and inclusive experience. <br><br>What if you&#39;re not tall, but dating-up is your thing? You&#39;ve still found the right place. While tall people are treated like VIP on DateUp, everyone is welcome to the party.",
